      "sc:description": "e3SIM is an open-source, agent-based simulator designed to model infectious disease dynamics by explicitly integrating epidemiological, ecological, and evolutionary processes (epi-eco-evo). It allows for realistic simulations of pathogen spread, mutation, and environmental factors in diverse host-pathogen systems.",
